{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saddle up and get ready for a paw-some adventure in Cats Visiting Wild West! Explore charming hand-drawn scenes filled with saloons, dusty towns, steam trains, and desert canyons \u2014 all packed with mischievous hidden cats waiting to be found.<br><br>Search every corner of these nostalgic Wild West illustrations and test your observation skills. From sneaky cats hiding in barrels to ones peeking out of cowboy hats, can you find them all?<br><br>Each scene also hides a special collectible object \u2014 gather them all to complete your Wild West collection!<br><br>Features:<br>5 beautifully illustrated Wild West scenes<br>80 hidden cats to find in each level<br>A collectible item hidden in every scene<br>Relaxing gameplay perfect for casual players<br>Timer and leaderboard for competitive cat hunters<br><br>Grab your hat, partner \u2014 those kitties won\u2019t find themselves!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lone Ranger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3970930/b4afe32acc07b8800a36fa7f89301b8c652b9100.jpg"},{"name":"Quick on the Draw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3970930/2aeacb632d118efc7b966c8a9967b5fa29053037.jpg"},{"name":"All Aboard the Station","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3970930/eaece2151be550d930f1279fcf90614df46d7a1f.jpg"},{"name":"Life on the Ranch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3970930/ef4f3661c81d6e916dbbc9afb22846c2b34af972.jpg"},{"name":"Campfire Watch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3970930/d89c4bdc14ed36f8944b9d221f0804e9a44e1ae4.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Rush Cats","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3970930/7e1a722a1fd067cefdf192bd3a4255e9f6c455ce.jpg"},{"name":"Main Street Mystery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/